Docs.remarks:
A JSON merge patch is applied for existing users
Below is the JSON schema for the request and response payloads.
Request Body:
Schema for LedgerUser: { assignedRole: "Administrator" | "Contributor" | "Reader", # Required. Represents an assignable role. userId: string, # Optional. Identifier for the user. This must either be an AAD object id or a certificate fingerprint. }
Response Body:
Schema for LedgerUser: { assignedRole: "Administrator" | "Contributor" | "Reader", # Required. Represents an assignable role. userId: string, # Optional. Identifier for the user. This must either be an AAD object id or a certificate fingerprint. }

